    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i finally did it. i got the promotion and the corner office... everything i spent ten years working for is actually right here in front of me. but i'm just sitting here staring at the view and i feel absolutely nothing. it’s like i reached the top of a mountain only to realize there's nothing there. i don't even know why i'm still trying to keep going.",
