      "content": "yeah. it's exactly like that. it feels pointless to just keep existing when the purpose is gone. i've spent my whole life running toward this one thing, and now that i'm here, i just feel so tired. like, if the mission is over, what is the point of staying in the game? isn't there just a certain kind of peace in finally being able to let go of the struggle entirely?",
